<title>THAILAND: Union Bank Q3 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Union Bank Q3 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Third quarter</p>
<p>				     1996		 1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		   0.79	vs     1.26</p>
<p>    Net			   59.16	vs    94.52</p>
<p>NOTES: Nine month figures not stated. Company's full name is Union Bank of Bangkok Plc, a Thai commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
